## DB service
# The write path. Merging to `dev` deploys the db to the only db Space there is,
# so these files are the shortest route in the repository to the live index --
# and the failure they can cause is the one the contract does NOT catch: writes
# that are schema-valid but semantically wrong, such as a broken thread
# rendering, which land silently and are only undone by a backfill.
services/db/app/ @aditeyabaral @joshua-rajj
services/db/scripts/ @aditeyabaral @joshua-rajj
services/db/app/contract.py @aditeyabaral @joshua-rajj
